('85', 'typewriter or similar ribbons, whether or not on spools or in cartridges (classified according to their constituent material, or in heading 9612 if inked or otherwise prepared for giving impressions), or monopods, bipods, tripods and similar articles, of heading 9620', ARRAY['96']::text[], '9612', 'Section XVI Note 1(q)', 'This Section does not cover: (a) transmission or conveyor belts or belting, of plastics of Chapter 39, or of vulcanised rubber (heading 4010); (b) articles of leather of heading 4205 or of furskin (heading 4303); (c) bobbins, spools, cops, cones, cores, reels or similar supports; (d) perforated cards for Jacquard machines; (e) transmission belts of textile material (heading 5910); (f) precious stones of headings 7102 to 7104; (g) parts of general use of base metal (Section XV) or plastics (Ch...'),
('86', 'Air-cushion vehicles designed to travel over land or over both land and water — classified in Chapter 87 (NOT Ch.86)', ARRAY['87']::text[], NULL, 'Section XVII Note 5(b)', 'Air-cushion vehicles are to be classified within this Section with the vehicles to which they are most akin as follows: (a) in Chapter 86 if designed to travel on a guide-track (hovertrains), (b) in Chapter 87 if designed to travel over land or over both land and water, (c) in Chapter 89 if designed to travel over water, whether or not able to land on beaches or landing-stages or also able to travel over ice.'),
('86', 'Air-cushion vehicles designed to travel over water (whether or not able to land on beaches or landing-stages or also able to travel over ice) — classified in Chapter 89', ARRAY['89']::text[], NULL, 'Section XVII Note 5(c)', 'Air-cushion vehicles are to be classified within this Section with the vehicles to which they are most akin as follows: (a) in Chapter 86 if designed to travel on a guide-track (hovertrains), (b) in Chapter 87 if designed to travel over land or over both land and water, (c) in Chapter 89 if designed to travel over water, whether or not able to land on beaches or landing-stages or also able to travel over ice.'),
('88', 'Air-cushion vehicles (hovercraft) designed to travel on a guide-track (hovertrains) — classified in Chapter 86', ARRAY['86']::text[], NULL, 'Section XVII Note 5(a)', 'Air-cushion vehicles are to be classified within this Section with the vehicles to which they are most akin as follows: (a) in Chapter 86 if designed to travel on a guide-track (hovertrains), (b) in Chapter 87 if designed to travel over land or over both land and water, (c) in Chapter 89 if designed to travel over water, whether or not able to land on beaches or landing-stages or also able to travel over ice.'),
('88', 'Air-cushion vehicles designed to travel over land or over both land and water — classified in Chapter 87', ARRAY['87']::text[], NULL, 'Section XVII Note 5(b)', 'Air-cushion vehicles are to be classified within this Section with the vehicles to which they are most akin as follows: (a) in Chapter 86 if designed to travel on a guide-track (hovertrains), (b) in Chapter 87 if designed to travel over land or over both land and water, (c) in Chapter 89 if designed to travel over water, whether or not able to land on beaches or landing-stages or also able to travel over ice.'),
('88', 'Air-cushion vehicles designed to travel over water — classified in Chapter 89', ARRAY['89']::text[], NULL, 'Section XVII Note 5(c)', 'Air-cushion vehicles are to be classified within this Section with the vehicles to which they are most akin as follows: (a) in Chapter 86 if designed to travel on a guide-track (hovertrains), (b) in Chapter 87 if designed to travel over land or over both land and water, (c) in Chapter 89 if designed to travel over water, whether or not able to land on beaches or landing-stages or also able to travel over ice.')
